; GLQuakeCensus -- what GLQuake asks a minigl.library for, frame by frame:
; timedemo demo1, demo2 and demo3 against the census back end
; (docs/census.md). Each demo runs in the background (DEV:Test/RunCensus)
; with up to 10 minutes; one that does not finish is reported with Status
; and a screen grab, and the script moves on.
; Needs: gmake glquake glquake-data census-lib.
; LIMIT 2100
FailAt 1000
Wait 12
Echo "=== machine ===" >DEV:Test/auto.log
CPU >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Stack 1000000
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/census-#?
Echo "=== demo1 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunCensus demo1
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/census-demo1.done
Type DEV:Test/census-demo1.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== demo2 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunCensus demo2
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/census-demo2.done
Type DEV:Test/census-demo2.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== demo3 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunCensus demo3
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/census-demo3.done
Type DEV:Test/census-demo3.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== done ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
